{
    "title": "Back Market - Buy & Sell tech",
    "description": "<b>Back Market is the best marketplace to snag premium quality refurbished tech</b> like smartphones, laptops, game consoles, and tablets <b>at up to 70% less than brand new.</b> Better for your wallet, better for the planet.\r\n\r\nWith our app you can:\r\n \r\n\ud83d\uded2 Shop for refurbished tech (premium quality used electronics)\r\n\ud83d\udce6 Keep tabs on all your orders\r\n\u2b50 Save your fave devices\r\n\ud83d\udd14 Track price drops\r\n\ud83d\udcb0 Assess your tech for trade-in\r\n \r\n<h1><b>Buy online refurbished devices from certified refurbishers </b></h1> \r\n\r\n\u2705 Every device comes with a free 1-year warranty. \r\n\u2705 Free shipping on every order\r\n\u2705 30 days to change your mind\r\n\u2705 Track your order in app\r\n\u2705 Pay for your device in installments\r\n\u2705 5% discount for college students\r\n\r\nNo need to wait for sales, or special deals and promotions, refurbished electronics sold on Back Market are up to 70% less than new year-round. Plus, our quality charter means our refurbished tech is a grade above other marketplaces like Amazon and on the used electronics you find on the classified ads.\r\n\r\nFor anything else, our in-house customer service team is ready to chat, 6 days a week.\r\n\r\n<h1><b>Whatever you\u2019re looking for, we\u2019ve got the (refurbished) tech to buy for less than brand new.</b></h1> \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf4f<b>Apple Products</b> (iPhone, AirPods, MacBook, iPad, Apple Watch, iMac...)\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 <b>Smartphones</b> (Apple iPhone, Samsung Galaxy, Huawei, Xiaomi, Google Pixel, Sony Xperia, OnePlus, Honor...)\r\n\ud83c\udf6b <b>Tablets</b> (Apple iPad, Microsoft Surface Pro, Samsung Galaxy Tab, Huawei MediaPad\u2026)\r\n\ud83d\udcbb <b>Office laptops & PC gaming</b> (Apple MacBook, ultra-portable Microsoft Surface Book, Lenovo, Dell, HP, Asus, Acer...)\r\n\ud83c\udfae <b>Video game consoles</b> (Microsoft Xbox, Sony PlayStation, Nintendo Switch...)\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 <b>Headphones & Speakers</b> (Bose, Sony, Beats, JBL\u2026)\r\n\ud83d\udcf7 <b>Cameras & Camcorders</b> (Canon, Nikon, Pentax, Sony, Polaroid, GoPro\u2026)\r\n\ud83d\udcfa <b>4K TV, Video projectors, Home Cinema</b> (Samsung, LG, Sony, Panasonic, Apple TV\u2026)\r\n\ud83c\udf88 <b>Drones, Scooters, Smartwatch, Household appliances, Beauty, Health, Do-it-yourself...</b>\r\n\r\n<h1><b>Sell your unwanted tech for cash with Back Market Trade-In. It's easy</b></h1>\r\n\u267b Sell your smartphone, tablet, gaming console, MacBook or headphones\r\n\u267b Receive an offert from our expert refurbishers in minutes\r\n\u267b Shipping covered by Back Market\r\n\u267b Get cash money in your bank account within 6 business days from receipt of your electronic device.\r\n\r\nMake sure your tech is giving 100.\r\n \r\nUse Back Market\u2019s in-app assessment to test your phone's functionality. You\u2019ll get a rundown of these key metrics in seconds.\r\n\r\n\u2699 Network and connections (3G, 4G, GPS, Bluetooth and Wifi)\r\n\u2699 Audio and video performance (microphone, speakers, camera)\r\n\u2699 The screen (touch, multitouch, brightness, color, 3D Touch)\r\n\u2699 Sensors (Touch ID, Face ID, Gyroscope, Accelerometer) \r\n\r\nChoosing refurbished helps out your wallet - and the planet. Refurbished tech has up to 95% less of an impact on the environment compared to brand new.\r\n\r\n<h1><b>Comments and opinions?</b></h1>\r\nWe built this app for you. Help us to improve. Send us your opinions, comments and suggestions at feedbackapp@backmarket.com.\r\n \r\nAre you happy with our app? Sharing is caring. Leave a rating and a comment on the Google Play Store!\r\n\r\nWe're just an app away. \ud83d\ude00",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Back Market is the best marketplace to snag premium quality refurbished tech</b> like smartphones, laptops, game consoles, and tablets <b>at up to 70% less than brand new.</b> Better for your wallet, better for the planet.<br><br>With our app you can:<br> <br>\ud83d\uded2 Shop for refurbished tech (premium quality used electronics)<br>\ud83d\udce6 Keep tabs on all your orders<br>\u2b50 Save your fave devices<br>\ud83d\udd14 Track price drops<br>\ud83d\udcb0 Assess your tech for trade-in<br> <br><h1><b>Buy online refurbished devices from certified refurbishers </b></h1> <br><br>\u2705 Every device comes with a free 1-year warranty. <br>\u2705 Free shipping on every order<br>\u2705 30 days to change your mind<br>\u2705 Track your order in app<br>\u2705 Pay for your device in installments<br>\u2705 5% discount for college students<br><br>No need to wait for sales, or special deals and promotions, refurbished electronics sold on Back Market are up to 70% less than new year-round. Plus, our quality charter means our refurbished tech is a grade above other marketplaces like Amazon and on the used electronics you find on the classified ads.<br><br>For anything else, our in-house customer service team is ready to chat, 6 days a week.<br><br><h1><b>Whatever you\u2019re looking for, we\u2019ve got the (refurbished) tech to buy for less than brand new.</b></h1> <br><br>\ud83c\udf4f<b>Apple Products</b> (iPhone, AirPods, MacBook, iPad, Apple Watch, iMac...)<br>\ud83d\udcf1 <b>Smartphones</b> (Apple iPhone, Samsung Galaxy, Huawei, Xiaomi, Google Pixel, Sony Xperia, OnePlus, Honor...)<br>\ud83c\udf6b <b>Tablets</b> (Apple iPad, Microsoft Surface Pro, Samsung Galaxy Tab, Huawei MediaPad\u2026)<br>\ud83d\udcbb <b>Office laptops &amp; PC gaming</b> (Apple MacBook, ultra-portable Microsoft Surface Book, Lenovo, Dell, HP, Asus, Acer...)<br>\ud83c\udfae <b>Video game consoles</b> (Microsoft Xbox, Sony PlayStation, Nintendo Switch...)<br>\ud83c\udfa7 <b>Headphones &amp; Speakers</b> (Bose, Sony, Beats, JBL\u2026)<br>\ud83d\udcf7 <b>Cameras &amp; Camcorders</b> (Canon, Nikon, Pentax, Sony, Polaroid, GoPro\u2026)<br>\ud83d\udcfa <b>4K TV, Video projectors, Home Cinema</b> (Samsung, LG, Sony, Panasonic, Apple TV\u2026)<br>\ud83c\udf88 <b>Drones, Scooters, Smartwatch, Household appliances, Beauty, Health, Do-it-yourself...</b><br><br><h1><b>Sell your unwanted tech for cash with Back Market Trade-In. It&#39;s easy</b></h1><br>\u267b Sell your smartphone, tablet, gaming console, MacBook or headphones<br>\u267b Receive an offert from our expert refurbishers in minutes<br>\u267b Shipping covered by Back Market<br>\u267b Get cash money in your bank account within 6 business days from receipt of your electronic device.<br><br>Make sure your tech is giving 100.<br> <br>Use Back Market\u2019s in-app assessment to test your phone&#39;s functionality. You\u2019ll get a rundown of these key metrics in seconds.<br><br>\u2699 Network and connections (3G, 4G, GPS, Bluetooth and Wifi)<br>\u2699 Audio and video performance (microphone, speakers, camera)<br>\u2699 The screen (touch, multitouch, brightness, color, 3D Touch)<br>\u2699 Sensors (Touch ID, Face ID, Gyroscope, Accelerometer) <br><br>Choosing refurbished helps out your wallet - and the planet. Refurbished tech has up to 95% less of an impact on the environment compared to brand new.<br><br><h1><b>Comments and opinions?</b></h1><br>We built this app for you. Help us to improve. Send us your opinions, comments and suggestions at feedbackapp@backmarket.com.<br> <br>Are you happy with our app? Sharing is caring. Leave a rating and a comment on the Google Play Store!<br><br>We&#39;re just an app away. \ud83d\ude00",
